WEBVTT

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:11.290
Do you know about cats?

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:13.580
Cute ears that wiggle sensitively...

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:16.870
Tails that wag expressively,
responding to emotions...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.910
Attached to a bipedal creature
of the utmost charm...

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.660
Do you like cats like that?

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:29.910
If so, please visit this patisserie.

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:34.700
The cutest cats you've
ever seen await you there!

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.120
Welcome!

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:38.450
Welcome to La Soleil!

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:18.410
♪ Ponzu, ponzu, ponzu for delicious tuna! ♪

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:21.330
I'm home!

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.080
Hmm?

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:29.000
Huh?

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:34.700
Y-Y-You followed Chocola home?!

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.370
Y-You can't!

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:42.160
If you left without telling anyone,
your master would worry!

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:45.330
Master...?

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:49.000
Wait, are you a master-less cat?

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:53.830
In that case...

00:02:54.910 --> 00:02:58.700
You're just like how we were back then...

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:05.950
Oh, I didn't notice you came back.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.250
Y-Yes! Chocola is home!

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.120
What are you doing there?

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:15.750
Wh-What, you ask?
Well, um, catching my breath, of course!

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:24.700
What's with all the sweat?
Are you feeling unwell?

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.620
N-No! Not at all!

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:30.290
This is, uh, because of all the running...

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:34.080
I guess you really couldn't wait
for the tuna, huh?

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.250
Exactly!

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:38.790
Well, let's eat, then.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:41.080
Vanilla won't be able to wait
much longer either.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.790
I'll set up, so you go ahead and get changed.

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:47.700
Y-Yes!

00:03:55.660 --> 00:04:00.500
Listen, Chocola will handle this,
so follow close.

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:26.910
Good.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:30.040
Now's our chance to sneak into the room...

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:38.250
Whoa! V-V -Vanilla! What are you doing here?!

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:43.830
It was too painful waiting in front of
the tuna, so I waited in my room.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:47.870
Right, of course. Nothing wrong
with that, nothing out of place!

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:52.080
You're acting weird. Is something wrong?

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.160
Oh, right!

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:01.290
Here, take this!

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:06.660
"Full of umami and body,
Broth-In Ponzu"
Oh!

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:10.700
Chocola is capable of errands. Quite impressive.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:18.870
Later, I will reward you with a massage
for all the running you did.

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:21.620
Your hands are kind of creepy, Vanilla...

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:24.290
You can look forward to it.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:25.500
R-Right...

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:30.870
Master, the ponzu has arrived, let's eat.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:39.580
Huh? She's not here? Where did she go?

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:48.000
What are you doing here?

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.370
Chocola.

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:56.910
Chocola, hurry. You'll be doing the tuna
a disservice if you wait any longer.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:57.950
Oh...

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:04.450
♪ Ponzu, ponzu! ♪

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:09.450
♪ Tuna is best with ponzu! ♪

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:11.790
Will she be okay?

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:17.290
Hey, Master, where are you going?

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:19.080
Huh? The toilet.

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:20.160
What?!

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:21.660
No!

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:23.870
Ow! What's this about?

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:27.540
--Um, um, the t-toilet is dangerous!
--Huh?

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:31.620
G-Ghosts! Ghosts are there--
you'll get scared and soil yourself!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.250
Just do your business in a corner somewhere!

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:36.120
Stop being silly! I'm not a cat like you!

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:41.120
We aren't kittens anymore,
we don't just do it in random places.

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:45.250
That's just a thing that Cinnamon does
when she's too excited.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.000
Ah-choo!

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:50.870
Is someone talking about me?

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:53.120
Hey! I can't hold it in forever!

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:57.290
Chocola will clean up for you if you can't!

00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:59.250
I've had enough of this.

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:00.830
No!

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.450
Huh?

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:05.910
How...?

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:12.910
Let's eat.

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:24.080
This is... bliss...

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:26.250
Yes, it's delicious.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:30.790
No wonder Shigure wanted
Maple and Cinnamon to bring it over.

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:34.830
Not only is the tuna fresh,
the harmony with the ponzu is...

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.080
...exquisite!

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:42.870
Where did she go...?

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:44.250
Could she have...

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:49.750
...gotten caught in the toilet
when she sat down, and fell through...?!

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.910
What's wrong, Chocola? Not hungry?

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.660
H-Hey!

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:05.080
What's with Chocola?

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:09.870
This must mean I should
eat her share of the tuna.

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:11.790
How does that compute?

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:16.200
Knew it!

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:19.910
Hey, are you down there?!
Say something if you can hear me!

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:25.040
Wh-What should Chocola do...?

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:29.910
How can Chocola pull her out of there...?

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:31.040
Yes!

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:33.870
That thing! Chocola can use it...

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:36.700
...to save her!

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.290
It must be in the cleaning tools
shed in the store...

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:52.160
Thank goodness!

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:56.370
Chocola was so worried that
something terrible happened!

00:08:57.790 --> 00:08:59.950
Thank goodness!

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:03.450
I'm hungry.

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:07.700
Oh, r-right, of course. It's dinner time.

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:12.580
Apologies for not noticing. Chocola will
bring something, so sit tight, okay?

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:27.120
Thank you for the food!

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:43.200
What is she up to?

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:53.200
Here, nibble on this. It's yummy.

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:01.040
You like it?

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:07.500
Good, good.

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:16.950
Are you thirsty? Do you want a drink?

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:20.790
Milk.

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:23.410
Oh, um...

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:24.700
Do you mean...

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:35.200
No!

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:36.450
No, what?

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:39.500
Because that means... Ch-Chocola's...

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:44.620
Stare...

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:50.660
Who is this? Why is she here?

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:53.120
Oh, um, well...

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:56.910
U-Uh, how should Chocola say...

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:01.410
Um...

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:15.540
Cute...

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:16.790
Huh?

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:31.910
I see. I understand.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:35.160
But we are our master's cats.

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:39.500
We shouldn't be doing these
things behind his back.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:42.250
You're right...

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:45.330
Why didn't you talk to him about this?

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:47.000
Well...

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:49.200
Don't you remember, Vanilla?

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:53.410
It was right after the store opened,
and everyone came to help.

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:57.160
Finally finished.

00:11:57.160 --> 00:12:00.700
That was super busy with lots of customers.

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:03.830
Looks like this place is gonna be a big success.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:07.120
It could just be the novelty
of a store that just opened.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:09.830
Who knows if the popularity would last?

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:12.330
Dear brother, why so negative?!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:17.500
No other business has so many cute cats!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:25.040
As a cats' paradise, you should strive
to conquer all of Japan-- No, the world!

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:28.870
Um, this is just a local confectionary...

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:33.750
Chocola will help lots and lots,
as the store's main draw!

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:35.120
Same here.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.540
I envy Chocola and Vanilla.

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:42.120
Living here, you can eat
Kashou-<i>sama</i>'s cake every day.

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:46.000
I want to live here, too.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:50.660
Don't be silly. I have my hands full
just having Chocola and Vanilla around.

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:53.120
Just taking care of the store is enough work.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:56.750
I can't take care of any more cats.

00:12:57.870 --> 00:13:02.870
True... He did say
he can't have any more cats...

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:07.410
If we asked master, and he said no...

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:21.580
Master will not say no.

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:26.660
Because he is our master.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:27.660
No.

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:30.120
That was unexpected.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:32.410
B-B-But why not?!

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:36.450
Until we determine for sure
that she really is abandoned,

00:13:36.450 --> 00:13:39.580
we can't just decide to take her in.

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:45.290
--But...
--Maybe she just walked out
of the house and got lost.

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:51.580
Oh... In that case,
Chocola has to find where her house is!

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:57.790
If she is just lost, Chocola is
a kidnapper for keeping her around...

00:13:57.790 --> 00:14:00.660
--What?!
--Just calm down.

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:04.950
For starters, we should ask
the expert in these matters.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:16.540
Don't interrupt me!

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.330
--It's not fair, you're hogging the attention!

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:18.950
--Come on, you two,
don't fight--just wait your turn...
--It's not fair, you're hogging the attention!

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:20.700
--Come on, you two,
don't fight--just wait your turn...
--It's my turn now!

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.790
--Come on, you two,
don't fight--just wait your turn...
--You can't hold back, you jump right away.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:24.200
--Oh, hello, dear brother!
How was the tuna?
--What?!

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:26.000
--Oh, hello, dear brother!
How was the tuna?
--It's just true.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:27.540
--Oh, hello, dear brother!
How was the tuna?
--Just switch with me--

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:30.580
--Oh, hello, dear brother!
How was the tuna?
--No, I'm still playing--

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:33.080
--Hmm?
--Hmm?

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:37.160
I understand. I will head over there now.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:42.290
Thanks for coming over.

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:43.450
It's okay.

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:50.330
As a human, it is my duty to respond 24/7,
for any cat-related issue.

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:53.120
Uh, right...

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:57.080
So the situation is as
I described on the phone...

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:59.290
I can't allow it.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:01.950
A-Another unexpected turn of events...

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:06.700
Abandoning a cat is unthinkable!
I can't allow any human to do that!

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:13.250
Such villains should be forced to dig
a hole and fill it again for about 30 years!

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:15.330
What kind of torture is that...?

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:19.200
Why are you so quick to determine
that she is abandoned?

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:24.830
Oh, you are right. You said
it is possible that she is just lost.

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:30.450
I tried asking her while you were on your way,
but I couldn't get a clear answer.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:33.700
--When asked, "Who is your master?"
--She does this.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:37.040
--When asked, "Where is your house?"
--She does this.

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:41.040
Oh... That is troublesome.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:44.910
I understand. First, I will ask
around the cat owners' network

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:48.450
to see if a kitten has gone missing recently.

00:15:48.450 --> 00:15:49.580
Thanks.

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:55.870
You can count on me. For cats
and my dear brother, I will do anything.

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:57.410
So for starters...

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:59.250
I understand.

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:03.200
For the time being,
I will take care of her myself.

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:11.910
Don't worry.

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:15.450
Shigure is the expert in all cat matters.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:18.000
She won't let anything bad happen.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.870
You're right, yes.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:41.000
Hey, stop sniffing so much.
You're scaring the new kid.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:44.790
Especially since you're
so huge and intimidating.

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:47.330
But I'm curious.

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:49.080
I understand.

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:52.950
I have to say, a new cat
does pique my interest, too.

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:55.040
What, you, too, Cinnamon?

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.500
Yeah.

00:16:56.500 --> 00:17:00.830
She reminds me of you, May-<i>chan</i>,
when I first met you! Irresistible!

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:04.580
H-Hey! That took a sudden weird turn!

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:06.120
Calm down.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:11.370
I understand that you all are curious,
but do not bother her too much.

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:14.410
It is a new environment for her,
she could get nervous.

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:17.750
Try to leave her alone
until she gets comfortable.

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:25.500
Shigure, you seem to be
leaving her alone the least.

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:30.410
Th-This is, uh, a record of her growth...

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:36.370
And also, if I upload her photos online,
her master might find her.

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:40.370
That's gotta be for her
own personal photo collection...

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:42.200
Yeah...

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:45.830
Come on, it's time to take a bath.

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:49.540
Maple, you take an especially long time
in there, so do try to wrap up quickly.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.080
Yes.

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:54.370
And go straight to bed after the bath.

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:58.040
Staying up too late does
terrible things to your fur.

00:17:58.040 --> 00:17:59.330
Hey, Shigure-<i>sama</i>.

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:00.330
Yes?

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:02.950
Where is she sleeping tonight?

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:04.290
Hmm.

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:08.750
Let's see... I guess she will sleep with me
until she gets used to the house.

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:11.700
What? She's sleeping with Shigure-<i>sama</i>?!

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:14.330
What is it, Nuts?

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:16.370
Are you jealous?

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:21.540
You might have grown a lot bigger,
but you're still a kitten inside, aren't you?

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:25.540
Strong words for someone
who's still kitten-sized, Azuki!

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.450
--What?!
--What?

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:29.000
I'm not that small--

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:33.500
Come on, enough. Let's prepare the bath.

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:35.080
Yes.

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:38.410
Okay, let's bathe together.

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:51.370
We'll wash your body and hair.
It will be refreshing.

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:57.870
These clothes--they're quite
dirty and damaged.

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:04.040
I know! I still have the clothes
the other cats wore when they were small!

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:06.040
You can wear that tomorrow.

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:09.950
Okay, let's start with the shampoo.

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:18.500
Oh, not used to the shower yet. It's fine.

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:21.660
You will get used to it.

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:31.370
Look at how sticky your hair is.
Let's get you cleaned up!

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:34.370
Make sure your tail is clean, too!

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:38.000
Good job. You are very patient.

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:55.910
Those pajamas are from when I was smaller,
but I guess they are too big for you...

00:19:55.910 --> 00:19:59.790
But still... So cute!

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:05.410
Oh, the post-shampoo smell
and fluffiness is irresistible!

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:09.580
Oh, I lost control...

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:13.700
Please wait, I will prepare the bedding.

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:20.120
There, all ready.

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:22.910
Come here.

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:38.830
I see, you are more comfortable there.

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:44.120
But just to make sure you don't catch a cold...

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:45.540
...let's get this on you...

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:47.910
Oh...

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:52.830
She must have been tired,
being in a new environment.

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:58.830
Well, good night.

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:04.620
Has she fallen asleep already?

00:21:04.620 --> 00:21:06.040
Are you worried?

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:10.620
Is she behaving well in the other house?

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:13.870
I'm sure she's getting along
fine with the others.

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:15.330
Yes...

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:21.620
Hmm? What's wrong, Vanilla?

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:24.000
Chocola, I'll always be with you.

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:26.040
Vanilla...

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:31.290
Chocola... Too tight.

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:33.450
We should sleep now.

00:21:33.450 --> 00:21:34.450
Yes.

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:37.700
Good night, Vanilla.

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:40.000
Good night, Chocola.

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:21.830
"Illustration by IshiKei"
